            <p class="eyebrow">OUR STORY</p>
            <h2>A little passion.<br>A lot of <em>flavor.</em></h2>
            <p>
                At Maison, we believe the best meals are more than food.
                They're conversations that last longer, celebrations that
                feel warmer, and flavors that bring people together.
            </p>
            <p>
                Inspired by seasonal produce and timeless culinary
                traditions, every plate tells a story of craftsmanship,
                creativity, and care.
            </p>
            <a href="#chefs" class="text-link">Meet our culinary team ↗</a>

            <div class="stats">
                <div><strong>10+</strong><span>Years of passion</span></div>
                <div><strong>25+</strong><span>Signature dishes</span></div>
                <div><strong>100%</strong><span>Made with care</span></div>
            </div>
