        </div>
        <p class="menu-note">Sample menu and prices — customize these for your restaurant.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Ambience Section -->
    <section class="ambience section">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <p class="eyebrow">THE MAISON EXPERIENCE</p>
            <h2>Made for <em>Moments.</em></h2>
            <p>Soft lighting, thoughtful details, and an atmosphere that feels like home.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gallery">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517248135467-4c7edcad34c4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85" alt="Warm restaurant interior">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1414235077428-338989a2e8c0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=85" alt="Romantic fine dining table">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515003197210-e0cd7184f8b5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=85" alt="Beautifully plated cuisine">
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Chefs Section -->
    <section class="chefs-section section" id="chefs">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <p class="eyebrow">THE HANDS BEHIND THE MAGIC</p>
            <h2>Meet Our <em>Chefs</em></h2>
            <p>Passion on the plate begins with people who love what they do.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="chef-grid">
            <article class="chef-card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1577219491135-ce391730fb2c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=85" alt="Head chef portrait">
