                <span>Guest testimonial sample</span>
            </article>

            <article class="review-card featured-review">
                <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
                <blockquote>"A perfect blend of creativity and comfort. The service was warm, and every dish was a little work of art."</blockquote>
                <h4>Rahul M.</h4>
                <span>Guest testimonial sample</span>
            </article>

            <article class="review-card">
                <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
                <blockquote>"Beautiful interiors, thoughtful service, and wonderful flavors. Definitely a place for special occasions."</blockquote>
                <h4>Ananya R.</h4>
                <span>Guest testimonial sample</span>
